{
  "bridge_text": "那棵大树的树皮在寒风中微微震动，仿佛藏着无数个未完待续的秘密，正等待着莉娜去一一揭开。让我们跟着莉娜的脚步，看看在那层层树皮之后，究竟藏着什么样奇妙的世界。",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "莉娜站在大树下，那低沉的嗡嗡声仿佛在邀请她探索。她深吸一口气，拨开垂下的枯枝，发现树干内部竟是一条螺旋向下的木质阶梯。在最顶端的那级台阶上，坐着一只穿着补丁绿马甲的老灰狐狸，那正是莫斯克。他用如同秋日枯叶摩擦般干涩的声音，警告莉娜这里不欢迎访客，让她赶快回家忘记那阵嗡嗡声。可莉娜却昂起头，坚定地回答，她无法忘记那还没听完的故事。"
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "The secret of Mosk's grumpiness hides in the shadows of the tree, but perhaps his heart will soften as Lina takes her next step. She stands before him, apple in hand, waiting to see if he will turn her away.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Lina stood firm, her gaze meeting the fox's weary eyes. She knew the humming was a mystery that needed answering, and she was not ready to turn back into the woods just yet. She held her ground, waiting to see if the fox would truly bar her path."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed a shaky claw at the door, but Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last, crisp apple of the season. She set it on the step between them, a small gift for the trouble of her visit. Mosk stared at the fruit for a long time, his whiskers twitching. Then, without a word, he stood up, straightened his patched green vest, and stepped onto the first stair to lead her deeper into the hollow."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s2"
}

